WEBVTT

00:04:57.828 --> 00:05:02.432
And if you don't remember anything else
from my talk, please remember this.

00:05:02.465 --> 00:05:05.068
That for all of the gains
that we were trying to make

00:05:05.068 --> 00:05:07.237
with the civil rights movement --

00:05:07.237 --> 00:05:08.505
fair housing,

00:05:08.538 --> 00:05:11.041
expanded opportunities in education,

00:05:11.074 --> 00:05:12.509
employment opportunities,

00:05:12.542 --> 00:05:16.346
building the wealth
of the African-American community,

00:05:16.379 --> 00:05:22.786
the failed policies of the war on drugs
single-handedly undid all of that.

00:05:23.553 --> 00:05:25.956
(Applause)

00:05:28.525 --> 00:05:30.293
And here's how we know that.